<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>足球比赛深度分析系统</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto}
body{background:#0b0b0f;color:#e6e6e6;min-height:100vh;padding:20px}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px}
.header h1{color:#00d1ff;font-weight:700;font-size:28px}
.header p{color:#888;margin-top:5px}

.search-box{
background:#121218;
padding:20px;border-radius:12px;
margin-bottom:30px;
display:flex;gap:10px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
box-shadow:0 0 20px #0008
}
.search-box input{
flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:12px 15px;
background:#1a1a24;border:none;border-radius:8px;
color:#fff;font-size:16px;outline:none
}
.search-box button{
padding:12px 22px;background:#00a1ff;border:none;
border-radius:8px;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer
}
.search-box button:hover{background:#0088dd}

.grid{
display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px
}
@media(max-width:768px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.card{
background:#121218;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;
box-shadow:0 4px 12px #0006;position:relative;overflow:hidden
}
.card h3{
color:#00d1ff;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:16px;
display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px
}
.card .label{color:#777;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px}
.card .value{color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:600}
.card .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px}

.analysis{
background:#15151f;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:10px
}
.analysis p{line-height:1.6;color:#ccc}
.highlight{color:#00ffcc;font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="header">
<h1>⚽ 足球比赛深度分析系统</h1>
<p>历史战绩 · 盘口 · xG · 大小球智能分析</p>
</div>

<div class="search-box">
<input type="text" id="match" placeholder="输入比赛：例如 曼联 VS 曼城">
<button onclick="analyze()">开始分析</button>
</div>

<div id="result" style="display:none">
<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>📊 比赛信息</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="label">对阵</span><span class="value" id="team"></span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">联赛</span><span class="value">英超</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">开赛时间</span><span class="value">今日 23:00</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📈 历史战绩（近6场）</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="label">主队</span><span class="value">4胜1平1负</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">客队</span><span class="value">2胜2平2负</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">交锋</span><span class="value">2胜1平</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎯 预期进球 xG / xGA</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="label">主队 xG</span><span class="value">1.62</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">客队 xG</span><span class="value">1.18</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">总 xG</span><span class="value">2.80</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>💰 进球数赔率</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="label">初盘</span><span class="value">2.5球</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">大球</span><span class="value">1.92</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">小球</span><span class="value">1.88</span></div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
<h3>🧠 智能大小球分析</h3>
<div class="analysis">
<p id="resultText"></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<script>
function analyze(){
const match = document.getElementById('match').value
if(!match){alert('请输入比赛')}
document.getElementById('team').innerText = match
document.getElementById('result').style.display = 'block'

document.getElementById('resultText').innerHTML = 
'本场总预期进球 <span class="highlight">2.80</span>，接近 3 球，盘口 <span class="highlight">2.5球</span>。' +
'结合攻防数据与临场趋势，<span class="highlight">大球概率更高</span>。'
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
